SKU	TITLE	STATUS	CAPTION	CREATEDATE	CREATETIME	BODYCOPY2	Week of 11/07 - Version 0.0.0 of the Wiki has been released!	1	The Homepage has been created!	11/05/2025	13:05:27	11/05<br><br>We have finally created the Homepage, this is a step in the right direction torwards making full fledged Wiki website! Next update will be very soon and will be big.<br><br><img src="../../images/version000.png" alt="Sorry! This image is broken! We are currently working on fixing the issue!" style="width:100%"><br><br> 11/07<br><br>Nothing has gotten done, I am stumped on a piece of code. I have been trying to get a piece of code for my Wiki to work the whole week, it has been to no success. I am trying to get a piece of code to change the language of my whole website, it is more difficult than i thought. First I tried advanced Javascript to do it, but I could not wrap my head about it. So then I tried to get it done with WEBDNA, but that is not working either. I actually do not know how to solve this, so it will probably be put on the back burner for a while.3	Week of 11/14 - Version 0.0.1 of the Wiki has been released!	1	Language code done!	11/14/2025	14:18:32	11/14<br><br>The Language code is officially running in the new Version! There will be changes later on with this code to make it redirect you to the language page when you enter the website for the first time, but for now this is what we have. I also made an admin page and a page for picking your language as well while I was at it; so that is all for this week.<br><br><img src="../../images/version001.png" alt="Sorry! This image is broken! We are currently working on fixing the issue!" style="width:100%">4	Week of 11/21 - Version 0.0.2 has been released!	1	Not much done this week.	11/21/2025	13:23:30	11/21<br><br>I made small changes to certain HTML links so that the names made more sense with the function of the page it was on, I also added a confirm code on the admin for deleting records.5	Week of 11/28 - Version 0.0.3 has been released!	1	Mostly Developer and Website Admin things this update.	11/24/2025	14:06:34	11/24<br><br>I have added a navigation link that only shows up if a specific cookie equals a certain value. If it does show up, that means you are a developer or administrator for the website. If it does not, then you should not be able to access the Dev Page.5	Week of 12/5 - No new updates	1	Nothing new this week	12/03/2025	14:22:04	12/03<br><br>Unfortunately I have been busy with Javascript all week, so there are no changes this week.6	Week of 12/12 - A large front-end update	1	Login Code is done!	12/10/2025	14:24:37	12/10 - Version 4 and Login code in development<br><br>We are currently trying to make login code for our website, this login code will also help to improve the language code as well. It also will help make admin pages and dev pages more concrete and secure from public eyes. So stay tuned for the huge update coming this week!<br><br>12/11 - Login code done!<br><br> The login code is finally done, all I have to do is make it pretty. Which should be easy, I will also go around and improve other front-end things when I am doing the layout for the login.<br><br><img src="../../../images/version004indev.png" alt="Sorry! This image is broken! We are currently working on fixing the issue!" style="width:100%"><br><br>7	Week of 12/19 - Version 0.0.4 released!	1	Mostly just CSS, Layout, fixing links and backend stuff	12/17/2025	14:01:29	12/17 - Login Layout fixed!<br><br> Today the Layout of the login page was fixed, Navigation links were also worked on because some of them were not working. Another Admin has been created as well.<br><br><img src="../../../images/version004.png" alt="Sorry! This image is broken! We are currently working on fixing the issue!" style="width:100%">8	Week of 01/02 - Version 0.0.5 Indev	1	The code to create Content is finally getting developed, which is mostly back end.	01/01/2026	14:46:29	01/01 - Mostly back end stuff to create content<br><br>The databases for the content pages and creation are finally in development. It has been a long wait but we have finally arrived, the team will be sure to keep you updated.9	Week of 01/09 - Version 0.0.5	1	It is still being developed at this moment	01/07/2026	14:26:35	01/07 - Version 0.0.5 Status Update<br><br>Unfortunately it is still in development, it is rather complicated code that is very specific with writing. Version 0.0.5 may be done by the end of the week, there is no gurantee on that though.<br><br>01/08 - Version 0.0.5 progress report<br><br>I finally fixed the problem and am now back on track for the development of Version 0.0.5. <br><br> 01/09 - Version 0.0.5 released early!<br><br>Version 0.0.5 of the website has released early and only has the admin side of adding and editing content pages. Version 0.0.6 will have comments and the viewer side of the login interactions of the content stuff.10	Week of 01/16 - Version 0.0.6 near finished.	1	Version 0.0.6 will only be close to done by the end of this week due to SETBACKS.	01/12/2026	12:35:15	01/09 - Worky<br><br>I am writing this a few days late so I do not remember exactly what I was working on, all I know is that it was building the admin for the content pages though.<br><br>01/15 - Attempting to build comment code<br><br>I have started the Comment Code finally, it is giving me a rather hard time though. Hopefully tomorrow I can finish it and release version 0.0.6 to the public.<br><br>1/16 - Comment Code done!<br><br> The comment code for version 0.0.6 is finished, all that remains is touch ups and small changes to how the content pages work and then Version 0.0.6 is done!11	Week of 01/30 - Version 0.60 release	1	Version 0.60 released at end of the week!	01/27/2026	14:07:10	01/27 - Version 0.60 update <br><br>Version 0.0.6 will be released at end of the week, if there are no delays. I hope that there will be nothing that obstructs the production of the website, because the public released deadline is very soon.<br><br>01/30 - Version 0.60 released! <br><br>Version 0.60 has been released at end of the week, even with delays. I hope that there will be nothing that obstructs the next update of the website, because the public release deadline is less than a month away.12	Week of 02/06 - Version 0.80 indev	1	Content added and Version 0.80 In development!	02/04/2026	13:59:02	02/03 - Content addedMore Content pages have been added to the website, the public admin will be getting fixed very soon. Version 0.80 is also currently in development, there is no set timeline for it though.<img src="../../images/version061.png" alt="Sorry! This image is broken! We are currently working on fixing the issue!" style="width:100%"><br><br>02/04 - More Content added<br><br>Even more Content pages have been added to the website, the public admin will be getting fixed very soon. Version 0.80 is has no progress in development yet, there is still not a set timeline for it though.<img src="../../images/version062.png" alt="Sorry! This image is broken! We are currently working on fixing the issue!" style="width:100%"><br><br>02/05 - More Content added and public admin fixed<br><br>Another Content page has been added to the website, the public admin has been fixed I think. Version 0.80 is slowly but surely coming along, still no set timeline for it though.<img src="../../images/version067.png" alt="Sorry! This image is broken! We are currently working on fixing the issue!" style="width:100%">13	Week of 2/13 - Version 0.80 release	1	Almost done/Done!	02/11/2026	14:04:45	 2/11 - Search bar no worky<br><br> Unfortunately I did not get my search for the content page done like I wanted to so I will have to work on it more tomorrow. But the progress is going decently smooth on the final release of the website, so that is a win.<br><br>2/13 - Search Bar is worky now<br><br>My search bar is now working, I am now out of work time which means that this was buzzer beater. So now I get to proudly say that version 0.80 is released and the Website is (pretty much) ready for Public eyes.<br><br><img src="../../images/version080.png" alt="Sorry! This image is broken! We are currently working on fixing the issue!" style="width:100%"></textarea><br>